{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "先生", "id": "先生"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "懷", "id": "懷"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "說", "id": "說"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.180417459019838, "source": "臣", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "臣", "target": "懷"}, {"weight": 1.1507980418386798, "source": "臣", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7104138297741025, "source": "臣", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "說", "target": "先生"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "說", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.1507980418386798, "source": "說", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7104138297741025, "source": "說", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "先生", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 2.5734600471294455, "source": "先生", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.4384801142904609, "source": "先生", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "先生", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.02626677919258, "source": "志", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "王", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 1.0330150061822965, "source": "王", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5926307941177191, "source": "王", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.5370924029585704, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "義", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 2.180417459019838, "source":